hi Marc and everyone,
 I agree with grouping the data into about 1 week or so intervals but also I wouldn't worry too much about defining a site as long as the camera traps aren't highly clustered or close together (ideally a quasi-systematic design would be ideal). The camera trap location as a site is just fine for estimating area occupied of each species I think.
  regards
andy

